    "enUS": {
      "description": "That recipe sure will come in handy.  I'd better get to work so I can have some smoked desert dumplings ready for today.  I could use a hand in making some, I'll make it worth your while.",
      "dialogue": {
        "2efa23ff4635c0f3f956": "That recipe sure will come in handy.  I'd better get to work so I can have some smoked desert dumplings ready for today.  I could use a hand in making some, I'll make it worth your while.",
        "7e6c51faaf4f75fc4142": "How are those dumplings coming along? ",
        "c49a42fae4f3f116cc6c": "Excellent! You're a life saver. These dumplings turned out to be quite good. Didn't really expect such good taste from the Twilight's Hammer."
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
